WEBVTT

00:33:58.224 --> 00:34:00.726
Jeff: I'm Jeff Harris,
I'm a photographer.

00:34:00.750 --> 00:34:03.828
AG: They work for different companies
and have never met before,

00:34:03.852 --> 00:34:06.062
but that doesn't stop Jeff
from opening up.

00:34:06.667 --> 00:34:09.483
Jeff: Already, I'm feeling
a little bit emotional about it,

00:34:09.507 --> 00:34:12.736
because I do experience
a lot of isolation in the workplace.

00:34:12.760 --> 00:34:15.726
I used to work with a big group of people

00:34:15.750 --> 00:34:17.854
and over the years,
the industry has changed.

00:34:17.878 --> 00:34:20.626
I'm a photographer
and so I find myself to be alone.

00:34:20.650 --> 00:34:23.206
I miss that sense of camaraderie.

00:34:23.230 --> 00:34:27.196
Alex: You already shared something that's
a bit vulnerable, but I'm kind of curious:

00:34:27.220 --> 00:34:30.144
What is the biggest challenge
you're facing at work right now